# The tests' support: the tests' clang-tidy, less the include checker.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -misc-include-cleaner
# misc-include-cleaner: the support starts processes, opens sockets and
#   makes certificates by POSIX's, Windows's and OpenSSL's own names, which
#   each system declares in headers of its own, apart from the public ones
#   a program includes, and differently on each, so the check cannot map
#   them the same on Linux and macOS (RULES.md D13).
...
